{"product_id":"fraction","title":"Fraction","description":"\u003cp\u003eFraction is here. \u003cbr\u003eAfter more than a year in development, this is our first-ever VST and it changes the way a plugin feels inside your DAW. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFraction is a sample based engine built from Pure Hardware but with Unmatched Controls unlike anything ever before.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe sampled\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003eevery note from real hardware and 16,000 sound recordings later, we spread them across 360 presets and 250 sound sources you can choose from. Synths, instruments, and pedals worth more than \u003cstrong\u003e$80k \u003c\/strong\u003ethat we used to make Fraction happen. No stretching, no shortcuts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut Fraction is more than Hardware Sound. It’s about unmatched \u003cstrong\u003econtrol\u003c\/strong\u003e. With features like the \u003cstrong\u003eAlgorythm XY Pad\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eFractalize\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eVintage\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eColor\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eSmooth\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eHumanize\u003c\/strong\u003e, every preset becomes a playground you can bend, twist, and shape in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis video walks you through Fraction, what makes it different, and why it’s more than just another VST.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔥 Highlights:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e360+ presets \/ 250+ sound sources\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMulti-velocity, Per Note sampling (up to 500 wavs per preset)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePure Hardware Sound: Prophet, Juno, Moog, Arturia, Polybrute \u0026amp; more\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustom controls never seen before in a VST such as The Algorythm, Color, Vintage, Fractalize and more\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eLifetime free updates — new presets and expansions included\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForming a new Era of Musical Software. \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFraction is now available at eraformaudio.com .\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Eraform, Prototype","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51377470963979,"sku":"","price":81.95,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/files\/product_basic_square.png?v=1778621594","url":"https:\/\/eraformaudio.com\/products\/fraction","provider":"Eraform Audio","version":"1.0","type":"link"}